      hu: ["Az ennis-i ferences kolostort 1240 körül alapították", "A város a Fleadh Cheoil na hÉireann zenei fesztivál helyszíne", "Az O'Connell-emlékművet 1867-ben állították fel", "Ennis 2005-ben Írország legtisztább városa volt", "A település mintegy 19 km-re fekszik a Shannoni repülőtértől", "A Szent Kolumba-templomot 1871-ben szentelték fel"],
      ro: ["Mănăstirea Ennis a fost fondată în jurul anului 1240", "Orașul este locul de desfășurare al Fleadh Cheoil na hÉireann", "Monumentul O'Connell a fost ridicat în anul 1867", "Ennis a fost cel mai curat oraș din Irlanda în 2005", "Orașul este situat la aproximativ 19 km de Aeroportul Shannon", "Biserica Sf. Columba a fost sfințită în anul 1871"],
      en: ["Ennis Friary was founded around the year 1240", "The town is a frequent host of the Fleadh Cheoil na hÉireann", "The O'Connell Monument was erected in the year 1867", "Ennis was named Ireland's tidiest town in 2005", "The town is located about 19 km from Shannon Airport", "St. Columba's Church was consecrated in 1871"],
