      en: "Midleton Distillery in County Cork is the powerhouse of modern Irish whiskey production. It is the birthplace of world-famous brands such as Jameson, Powers, and Redbreast. The site features both the historic 'Old Midleton Distillery' museum and a state-of-the-art production facility. Visitors can witness the world's largest pot still and learn about the traditional triple distillation process that defines Irish whiskey.",
