      en: "Teeling Whiskey Distillery opened in 2015 as the first new distillery in Dublin in over 125 years. It is located in the historic 'Liberties' area, once the world center of whiskey production. Teeling is known for its innovative approach, often aging whiskey in unique cask types. The distillery offers guided tours where visitors can experience the sights, sounds, and smells of a fully operational urban craft distillery.",
